{"id":"0d02b1ade49cc8e02288db4f45f075f124d94009","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"0d02b1ade49cc8e02288db4f45f075f124d94009","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/seo/Classes/XmlSitemap/XmlSitemapRenderer.php","lines":["@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\MutationCollection;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\MutationMode;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\PolicyRegistry;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\SourceKeyword;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\SystemResource\\Exception\\CanNotResolvePublicResourceException;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\SystemResource\\Exception\\CanNotResolveSystemResourceException;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\SystemResource\\Exception\\SystemResourceDoesNotExistException;","@@ -88,7 +89,7 @@ public function render(string $_, array $typoScriptConfiguration, ServerRequestI","         $sitemapName = is_string($sitemapName) && $sitemapName !== '' ? $sitemapName : null;","         $xslResource = $this->getXslResource($configConfiguration, $sitemapType, $sitemapName);","         if ($xslResource !== null) {","-            $this->applyDynamicContentSecurityPolicy($xslResource);","+            $this->applyContentSecurityPolicy($xslResource);","             $view->assign('xslFile', (string)$this->resourcePublisher->generateUri($xslResource, $request));","         }","         if ($sitemapName !== null) {","@@ -195,26 +196,29 @@ private function getXslResource(array $configConfiguration, string $sitemapType,","     }"," ","     /**","-     * Applies `Content-Security-Policy` mutations for `unsafe-hashes` for XSLT styles.","-     * This is done dynamically, since XSLT styles might change some day...","+     * Applies `Content-Security-Policy` mutations for the XSLT stylesheet:","+     *","+     * - Browsers evaluate XSLT against the `script-src` family. `'strict-dynamic'` invalidates","+     *   URL-based sources there, which is the only way the XSL file can be referenced. It is","+     *   therefore reduced and `'self'` is granted instead. For cacheable requests","+     *   `AvoidContentSecurityPolicyNonceEventListener` drops `'strict-dynamic'` already, but","+     *   sitemaps are rendered uncached as well, e.g. when a backend user is logged in.","+     * - Hashes of the XSLT styles are added to `style-src-elem`. This is done dynamically,","+     *   since XSLT styles might change some day...","      *","      * The expected hash for the default XSLT styles is `sha256-d0ax6zoVJBeBpy4l3O2FJ6Y1L4SalCWw2x62uoJH15k=`.","      */","-    private function applyDynamicContentSecurityPolicy(SystemResourceInterface $xslResource): void","+    private function applyContentSecurityPolicy(SystemResourceInterface $xslResource): void","     {","-        try {","-            $dom = new \\DOMDocument();","-            $dom->loadXML($xslResource->getContents());","-        } catch (SystemResourceDoesNotExistException) {","-            return;","-        }","-        $hashes = [];","-        foreach ($dom->getElementsByTagName('style') as $node) {","-            if ($node->getAttribute('type') !== 'text/css') {","-                continue;","-            }","-            $hashes[] = HashValue::hash($node->textContent);","-        }","+        $this->policyRegistry->appendMutationCollection(","+            new MutationCollection(","+                new Mutation(MutationMode::Reduce, Directive::ScriptSrc, SourceKeyword::strictDynamic),","+                new Mutation(MutationMode::Reduce, Directive::ScriptSrcElem, SourceKeyword::strictDynamic),","+                new Mutation(MutationMode::Extend, Directive::ScriptSrc, SourceKeyword::self),","+                new Mutation(MutationMode::Extend, Directive::ScriptSrcElem, SourceKeyword::self)","+            )","+        );","+        $hashes = $this->resolveStyleHashes($xslResource);","         if ($hashes === []) {","             return;","         }","@@ -228,4 +232,25 @@ private function applyDynamicContentSecurityPolicy(SystemResourceInterface $xslR","             )","         );","     }","+","+    /**","+     * @return list<HashValue>","+     */","+    private function resolveStyleHashes(SystemResourceInterface $xslResource): array","+    {","+        try {","+            $dom = new \\DOMDocument();","+            $dom->loadXML($xslResource->getContents());","+        } catch (SystemResourceDoesNotExistException) {","+            return [];","+        }","+        $hashes = [];","+        foreach ($dom->getElementsByTagName('style') as $node) {","+            if ($node->getAttribute('type') !== 'text/css') {","+                continue;","+            }","+            $hashes[] = HashValue::hash($node->textContent);","+        }","+        return $hashes;","+    }"," }"],"additions":42,"deletions":17,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/seo/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/noCache.typoscript","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1 @@","+config.no_cache = 1"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/seo/Tests/Functional/XmlSitemap/XmlSitemapContentSecurityPolicyTest.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,136 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3\\CMS\\Seo\\Tests\\Functional\\XmlSitemap;","+","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\Attributes\\Test;","+use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\Directive;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\MutationMode;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Security\\ContentSecurityPolicy\\SourceKeyword;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Frontend\\Tests\\Functional\\SiteHandling\\AbstractTestCase;","+use TYPO3\\TestingFramework\\Core\\Functional\\Framework\\Frontend\\InternalRequest;","+","+/**","+ * The XSL stylesheet of a sitemap is referenced by URL and evaluated against the","+ * `script-src` family, which must not be invalidated by `'strict-dynamic'`.","+ */","+final class XmlSitemapContentSecurityPolicyTest extends AbstractTestCase","+{","+    protected const LANGUAGE_PRESETS = [","+        'EN' => ['id' => 0, 'title' => 'English', 'locale' => 'en_US.UTF8'],","+    ];","+","+    protected array $coreExtensionsToLoad = ['seo'];","+","+    protected array $configurationToUseInTestInstance = [","+        'SYS' => [","+            'features' => [","+                'security.frontend.enforceContentSecurityPolicy' => true,","+            ],","+        ],","+        'FE' => [","+            'cacheHash' => [","+                'enforceValidation' => false,","+            ],","+        ],","+    ];","+","+    protected function setUp(): void","+    {","+        parent::setUp();","+        $this->importCSVDataSet(__DIR__ . '/../Fixtures/pages-sitemap.csv');","+        $this->setUpSitemapRootPage();","+        // note: a dedicated site identifier is used, since site related state of other test","+        // cases in this test suite would leak into this one otherwise","+        $this->writeSiteConfiguration(","+            'website-csp',","+            $this->buildSiteConfiguration(1, 'http://localhost/'),","+            [","+                $this->buildDefaultLanguageConfiguration('EN', '/'),","+            ],","+            [],","+            [],","+            [","+                'enforce' => [","+                    'inheritDefault' => true,","+                    'mutations' => [","+                        [","+                            'mode' => MutationMode::Extend->value,","+                            'directive' => Directive::ScriptSrc->value,","+                            'sources' => [\"'\" . SourceKeyword::strictDynamic->value . \"'\"],","+                        ],","+                        [","+                            'mode' => MutationMode::Extend->value,","+                            'directive' => Directive::ScriptSrcElem->value,","+                            'sources' => [\"'\" . SourceKeyword::strictDynamic->value . \"'\", 'https://cdn.example.org'],","+                        ],","+                    ],","+                ],","+            ],","+        );","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function cacheableSitemapAllowsLoadingXslStylesheetByUrl(): void","+    {","+        $csp = $this->getResponse()->getHeaderLine('Content-Security-Policy');","+        self::assertMatchesRegularExpression('#(^|;)\\s*script-src[^;]*\\'self\\'#', $csp);","+        self::assertMatchesRegularExpression('#(^|;)\\s*script-src-elem[^;]*\\'self\\'#', $csp);","+        self::assertStringNotContainsString(SourceKeyword::strictDynamic->value, $csp);","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function nonCacheableSitemapAllowsLoadingXslStylesheetByUrl(): void","+    {","+        // `AvoidContentSecurityPolicyNonceEventListener` keeps `'strict-dynamic'` for uncached requests","+        $this->setUpSitemapRootPage(['EXT:seo/Tests/Functional/Fixtures/noCache.typoscript']);","+        $csp = $this->getResponse()->getHeaderLine('Content-Security-Policy');","+        self::assertMatchesRegularExpression('#(^|;)\\s*script-src[^;]*\\'self\\'#', $csp);","+        self::assertMatchesRegularExpression('#(^|;)\\s*script-src-elem[^;]*\\'self\\'#', $csp);","+        self::assertStringContainsString('https://cdn.example.org', $csp);","+        self::assertStringNotContainsString(SourceKeyword::strictDynamic->value, $csp);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @param list<string> $additionalSetup","+     */","+    private function setUpSitemapRootPage(array $additionalSetup = []): void","+    {","+        $this->setUpFrontendRootPage(","+            1,","+            [","+                'constants' => ['EXT:seo/Configuration/TypoScript/XmlSitemap/constants.typoscript'],","+                'setup' => [","+                    'EXT:seo/Configuration/TypoScript/XmlSitemap/setup.typoscript',","+                    ...$additionalSetup,","+                ],","+            ]","+        );","+    }","+","+    private function getResponse(): ResponseInterface","+    {","+        return $this->executeFrontendSubRequest(","+            new InternalRequest('http://localhost/')->withQueryParameters([","+                'id' => 1,","+                'type' => 1533906435,","+                'tx_seo[sitemap]' => 'pages',","+            ])","+        );","+    }","+}",""],"additions":136,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":179,"deletions":17,"truncated":false,"file_count":3},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-18T16:51:51.337790+00:00"}